  <presentation id="masterclass-intro">
    <title short="Introduction">Masterclass: Welcome, Introduction, and Logistics</title>
    <author>Frank Kilcommins &amp; Erik Wilde</author>
    <date short="2026-08-21">August 21, 2026</date>
    <toc class="abstract">AI agents are starting to call APIs autonomously, chain services, and generate integrations that were never explicitly designed by developers. Most API ecosystems are not built for this kind of automated usage, which can lead to unpredictable behavior, unsafe workflows, and loss of control. In this hands-on masterclass, you will explore how AI agents interact with APIs and where automation introduces architectural risks, led by two OpenAPI Ambassadors with deep expertise in API design and governance.</toc>
