  <presentation id="ai-api-usage">
    <title short="AI-Driven API Usage">Module 1: Understanding AI-Driven API Usage</title>
    <author>Erik Wilde</author>
    <date short="2026-08-21">August 21, 2026</date>
    <toc class="abstract">How AI agents interact with APIs in modern systems: autonomous endpoint calls, service chaining, and generated integrations. Why traditional API governance models break under automated usage, and the architectural risks that follow. Hands-on exercise: map real-world AI interaction patterns onto your own APIs.</toc>
    <toc class="resources"><a href="https://github.com/dret/building-ai-ready-apis-india-2026">Masterclass materials (GitHub)</a></toc>
    <slide id="ai-api-usage-qr-code">
      <title>Workshop Materials</title>
      <img src="qr-code-workshop-materials-india-2026.png" href="https://github.com/dret/building-ai-ready-apis-india-2026" class="fullsize"/>
      <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://github.com/dret/building-ai-ready-apis-india-2026"><code>github.com/dret/building-ai-ready-apis-india-2026</code></a></p>
